-- Design and numbers: docs/VIRIDIAN-RISE-UPGRADE.md. Art: expansion/weapons/viridian/.
--
-- Each weapon clones its retail Stormwood sibling (the Infused Amber Collection's reward, wield 430
-- melee / 385 missile and caster) and changes only: name, descriptions, icon, setup, ObjScale,
-- damage type, EquipmentSetId 900, and one anim_part row (index 0 -> our GfxObj). No emote gives
-- them yet; @ci <wcid> on a staging shard to look at one.
--
--   ssh gpubox sudo -n mysql ace_world_staging < tools/gpubox-ace/viridian-arms.sql     (staging)
--   then @clearcache weenie. Server side needs RevivalGuard ViridianArms for the held model and the
--   set bonus; both properties default OFF (expansion_weapon_parts, viridian_set_bonus).
